{"id":"vod_bf_14194","vodId":"14194","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"欢迎来到加帕里公园第一季","name_cn":"欢迎来到加帕里公园第一季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/b704fb3c6cbc52e0ca2acc09e59de089.jpg"},"summary":"坐落在这个世界的某个角落的超大型综合动物园「加帕里公园」，依靠着那里的神秘物质「砂之星」的力量，动物一个个都变成了人类的模样。变身成为「兽娘」，来访的人们把她们称为「朋友（friends）」。在热闹中享受着梦幻般的时光。在加帕里公园顺利开业之前，其实有一场巨大危机。这是讲述跨越危机的朋友们和「园长」的冒险故事。担任公园向导的未来小姐和曾经参与冒险的薮猫一行，将这个故事记录了下来。救公园于危机之中的众多朋友们和「园长」出镜的乱哄哄的视频记录，你也来看看吧？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:27:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huanyinglaidaojiapaligongyuan/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-2